Third-party assets bundled with this application
================================================

Default hit samples
-------------------

`public/samples/Gameplay/` contains audio sample files taken verbatim from

    ppy/osu-resources  --  https://github.com/ppy/osu-resources

specifically its `osu.Game.Resources/Samples/Gameplay/` tree, retaining that
tree's three-tier layout (`ArgonPro/`, `Argon/`, and the shared tier beside
them) so they resolve the way osu!lazer's own skins resolve them.

