Copyright (c) ppy Pty Ltd <contact@ppy.sh>.

The licence requires attribution -- this notice -- and bars commercial use of
anything these files ship inside. This application is a personal,
non-commercial tool.

Only `.wav` and `.mp3` sample files are taken. The osu-resources fonts are
separately licensed and are not included, and the osu! and ppy trademarks are
excluded from the CC grant and are not used.

The osu!std-relevant subset is vendored: per-bank hit samples
(`{bank}-hit{normal,whistle,finish,clap}`), slider samples
(`{bank}-slider{tick,slide,whistle}`), the spinner samples and `combobreak`.
Files belonging to the other rulesets (`taiko-*`, `catch-banana`) and to game
surfaces this application does not have (`failsound*`, `rank-*`, `fountain-*`,
`nightcore-*`, `restart`, `resume-countdown`, `pause-loop`, `sectionfail`,
`sectionpass`) are not included.

Everything else in this repository is the project's own work; osu!lazer is
referenced for behavioural parity only, and no lazer source code is included.
